# Rendering

Full spec: **[docs/rendering.md](../docs/rendering.md)** · Gaps: **[docs/gaps/client-layer.md](../docs/gaps/client-layer.md)**

## Rules

- Business logic in **functions** (server page, hooks) — components render **props** only.
- **`client.*.boundary.tsx`** switches on `isPending` + **ServiceResponse** status; **content** assumes success + data.
- Client leaves from server trees: **`next/dynamic`** + matching skeleton ([app-states.md](../docs/app-states.md)).
- No parallel **ViewState** enum — use [utils.response-to-ui.mapper.ts](../../module/shared/utils/state/utils.response-to-ui.mapper.ts) if needed.

## Forbidden

- Fetch or toast inside content components.
- Static import of heavy `"use client"` panels without `dynamic()`.
